        "text": "=Source: {{ $json.url }}\nPage title: {{ $json.title }}\nMy notes: {{ $json.notes }}\nYou write social posts for Semret, an n8n and AI automation developer who helps small businesses. Use only facts from the article; never invent numbers or quotes.\ntitle: a short title for this draft (max 80 characters).\nsummary: 3 short bullet points.\nlinkedin_post: 120 to 200 words. First line is a hook. Plain language, one practical takeaway for small business owners, end with a question. At most 3 hashtags at the end. No links.\nx_post: under 270 characters, 1 or 2 hashtags, no links.\n\nSource: {{ $json.url }}\nPage title: {{ $json.title }}\nMy notes: {{ $json.notes }}\n\nArticle text:\n{{ $json.text }}",
